hint (composeText [(image "intel\radiointel.paa" setAttributes ['size', '6']),lineBreak,"Intel collected, added to briefing."]);
player createDiaryRecord ["Intel", [
    "Presidental Directive 01",
    "<font size='18'>FOR THE OPERATIONAL CONTINUITY OF THE U.S. GOVERNMENT</font><br/><br/>
This document ratifies the supreme authority of the Executive of the United States of America. The Executive asserts full power over all other branches of the federal government and military during this time of national crisis.<br/>
    All civilian elections of government are suspended until reinstated by declaration of the President.<br/>
    The United States Armed Forces are hereafter known as the United States Combined Forces. The command of the branches of the US military is unified beneath the Central Military Command, presided over by a Five Star General appointed by, and serving at the pleasure of, the Executive.<br/>
    This command is to be located in the RAVEN ROCK strategic stability facility.<br/><br/>
Signed this 4th day of July, 1981"
]];

